  "description": {
    "en": "Monthly hotel overnight stays for Switzerland and its 13 official tourism regions. The seasonal swing is large and regionally opposed — alpine regions peak in winter, urban regions do not — so the series is most informative sliced by region. Arrivals are published by the FSO alongside overnight stays but are not carried here."
